ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Placard::
    .string "3F  MEMORY\p"
    .string "What is kept, what fades, and what\n"
    .string "changes each time you take it out.\p"
    .string "The syllabus is on the desk.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Syllabus::
    .string "COURSE SYLLABUS\n"
    .string "3F  MEMORY\p"
    .string "TOPICS: STORING, FADING,\n"
    .string "CROWDING, RECALL, SPACING.\p"
    .string "All of it is on the board.\n"
    .string "The exam covers the board.\p"
    .string "PASS MARK: 80 out of 100.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_BoardIntro::
    .string "The board is written up neatly,\n"
    .string "in five parts.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Storing::
    .string "STORING\p"
    .string "Nothing is kept whole.\p"
    .string "What is kept is enough to build\n"
    .string "it again.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Fading::
    .string "FADING\p"
    .string "Left alone, it fades.\p"
    .string "Fastest at first. Then slower.\n"
    .string "Never quite to nothing.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Crowding::
    .string "CROWDING\p"
    .string "New things push on old ones, and\n"
    .string "old on new.\p"
    .string "The most alike are the most\n"
    .string "easily confused.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Recall::
    .string "RECALL\p"
    .string "Remembering is not reading a copy.\p"
    .string "It is building one, and the build\n"
    .string "is saved over the old.\p"
    .string "Remember it often enough, and\n"
    .string "you remember the remembering.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Spacing::
    .string "SPACING\p"
    .string "Once a day for five days beats\n"
    .string "five times in one day.\p"
    .string "Nobody believes this until they\n"
    .string "try it.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Teacher::
    .string "MEMORY.\p"
    .string "You will forget most of this\n"
    .string "floor.\p"
    .string "That is on the board as well.\n"
    .string "It is the second part.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Eleventh::
    .string "I know this page perfectly.\p"
    .string "Well. I know the last time I read\n"
    .string "it perfectly.\p"
    .string "The first ten are gone. I think the\n"
    .string "eleventh is standing on them.$"

ViridianCity_School_3F_Text_Friday::
    .string "Once a day, five days. That is\n"
    .string "what the board says.\p"
    .string "I am on day one.\n"
    .string "Ask me on Friday.$"
